/**
@mainpage Wiesel Engine Documentation

@section intro Overview

Wiesel is a cross-platform game engine built with C++ and Vulkan, featuring a
deferred PBR rendering pipeline, C# scripting via Mono, and a full-featured editor.

@section api API Reference

The API is split into two main sections:

@subsection engine_api C++ Engine API

Core engine systems written in C++. Use these when building native plugins,
editor extensions, or working on the engine itself.

- @ref Rendering "Rendering" - Renderer, pipelines, textures, materials, shaders, render features
- @ref Scene "Scene" - Entities, components, scene management, serialization
- @ref Physics "Physics" - Rigid bodies, colliders, mesh collider assets, raycasting
- @ref Audio "Audio" - Audio manager, spatial sound, reverb zones
- @ref Asset "Asset System" - Asset manager, loaders, serializers, VFS, handles
- @ref Animation "Animation" - Skeletal animation, state machines, sprite animation
- @ref UI "UI System" - Canvas, RmlUi integration, text rendering, input routing
- @ref Input "Input" - Keyboard, mouse, gamepad, input contexts, multi-player
- @ref Editor "Editor" - Editor layers, component inspectors, asset browser

@subsection scripting_api C# Scripting API

Game-facing API for C# scripts. Attach scripts to entities by inheriting from
@ref WieselEngine.MonoBehavior.

- @ref WieselEngine.MonoBehavior "MonoBehavior" - Script lifecycle (OnStart, OnUpdate, OnDestroy, etc.)
- @ref WieselEngine.Entity "Entity" - Find, create, destroy entities, get components
- @ref WieselEngine.Input "Input" - Keyboard, mouse, gamepad queries
- @ref WieselEngine.Physics "Physics" - Raycasting and overlap queries
- @ref WieselEngine.Audio "Audio" - Play sounds, music, spatial audio
- @ref WieselEngine.Settings "Settings" - Runtime graphics/audio settings
- @ref WieselEngine.SceneManager "SceneManager" - Scene loading and transitions
- @ref WieselEngine.Console "Console" - Developer console commands
- @ref WieselEngine.Time "Time" - Delta time, total time, frame count

<b>Components:</b>
@ref WieselEngine.TransformComponent,
@ref WieselEngine.ModelComponent,
@ref WieselEngine.CameraComponent,
@ref WieselEngine.RigidBodyComponent,
@ref WieselEngine.BoxColliderComponent,
@ref WieselEngine.SphereColliderComponent,
@ref WieselEngine.LightDirectComponent,
@ref WieselEngine.LightPointComponent,
@ref WieselEngine.AudioSourceComponent,
@ref WieselEngine.AnimatorComponent,
@ref WieselEngine.SpriteRendererComponent,
@ref WieselEngine.SpriteAnimatorComponent,
@ref WieselEngine.TextComponent,
@ref WieselEngine.UIDocumentComponent,
@ref WieselEngine.CanvasComponent

@section samples Sample Projects

Sample projects are maintained in a separate repository:
https://github.com/teoncreative/wiesel-samples

@section license License

Apache License 2.0
*/
